  "@graph": [
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/disaster/",
      "@type": "owl:Ontology",
      "label": {
        "ja": "災害対応",
        "en": "Disaster response"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "自治体の災害対応を表すデータモデル。避難所運用状況（EvacuationShelter）は、タスク管理サブジェクトのエイリアス・サブクラスではない独自の型で、共通の属性はタスク管理の IRI を持ちます（`project` はタスク管理の `Project` を指す関係属性ですが、災害事象そのものを表す型はこのカタログでは定義していません）。通行止めなどの通行規制は交通（transportation）サブジェクトの RoadRestriction です。高松市の水防アプリのデータモデルを基に汎用化したもの。",
        "en": "Data models for municipal disaster response. Shelter operation (EvacuationShelter) is its own type, neither an alias nor a subclass of the task subject; shared attributes carry the task subject's IRIs (`project` is a relationship to the task subject's `Project`, though this catalog does not itself define a type for the disaster event). Road closures and other road restrictions are RoadRestriction in the transportation subject. Generalised from the data models of Takamatsu City's flood-response application."
      },
      "versionInfo": "1.0.0",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/context/disaster/v1.0.0.jsonld"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/disaster/EvacuationShelter",
      "@type": "rdfs:Class",
      "label": {
        "ja": "避難所運用状況",
        "en": "Evacuation shelter operation"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "避難所の運用状況オーバーレイ1件。避難所そのもののマスタ（名称・位置）は含まず、外部の避難所データを externalShelterId / nationalShelterId で参照する。開設状況と避難者数だけを持つ。災害対策基本法第49条の7に基づき市町村長が指定する「指定避難所」（同法第49条の4の「指定緊急避難場所」とは別の概念）の運用を想定している。",
        "en": "Operational overlay for one evacuation shelter. The shelter master data (name, location) is not included; it is referenced by externalShelterId / nationalShelterId. Only opening status and evacuee counts live here. Models the operation of a 指定避難所 (designated shelter, Basic Act on Disaster Management Art. 49-7), a distinct legal concept from the 指定緊急避難場所 (designated emergency evacuation site, Art. 49-4)."
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/disaster/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/disaster/EvacuationShelter/"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/disaster/closedAt",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "closedAt"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "閉鎖日時",
        "en": "Time the shelter closed"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/disaster/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/disaster/EvacuationShelter/#closedAt"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/disaster/evacueeFemale",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "evacueeFemale"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "避難人数（女）",
        "en": "Number of female evacuees"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/disaster/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/disaster/EvacuationShelter/#evacueeFemale"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/disaster/evacueeHouseholds",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "evacueeHouseholds"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "避難世帯数",
        "en": "Number of evacuated households"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/disaster/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/disaster/EvacuationShelter/#evacueeHouseholds"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/disaster/evacueeMale",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "evacueeMale"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "避難人数（男）",
        "en": "Number of male evacuees"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/disaster/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/disaster/EvacuationShelter/#evacueeMale"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/disaster/evacueeTotal",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "evacueeTotal"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "避難人数合計",
        "en": "Total number of evacuees"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/disaster/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/disaster/EvacuationShelter/#evacueeTotal"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/disaster/externalShelterId",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "externalShelterId"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "自治体の指定緊急避難場所一覧（自治体標準オープンデータセット、デジタル庁）における ID（自治体内で一意。例 CC0100022200）。localGovernmentCode と合わせて全国で一意になる。デジタル庁の同データセットは「指定避難所」の一覧を項目定義していないため、この ID は「指定緊急避難場所」側の採番を借用している（下の nationalShelterId を参照）",
        "en": "The shelter's ID in the municipality's 指定緊急避難場所一覧 (自治体標準オープンデータセット, the Digital Agency's municipal standard open dataset; unique within the municipality, e.g. CC0100022200). Together with localGovernmentCode it identifies the shelter nationwide. That dataset has no item definition for 指定避難所 itself, so this ID borrows the emergency-evacuation-site list's numbering (see nationalShelterId below)"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/disaster/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/disaster/EvacuationShelter/#externalShelterId"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/disaster/nationalShelterId",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "nationalShelterId"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "全国共通避難所・避難場所ID（内閣府・新総合防災情報システム/SOBO-WEB、国土地理院「避難所等データ整備ウェブシステム」で採番）。14桁：固定値 E ＋ 自治体コード5桁＋施設コード5桁＋種別コード大分類（このモデルでは「1」＝指定避難所のみ有効）＋種別コード小分類（1＝一般避難所・2＝福祉避難所）＋種別連番（1から開始、0は無効）。国土地理院の指定緊急避難場所・指定避難所データ（CSV）にも「共通ID」列として収録される。未採番の避難所では、空文字ではなく属性自体を省略する",
        "en": "The nationwide common shelter/evacuation-site ID (assigned by the Cabinet Office's new comprehensive disaster information system, SOBO-WEB, via GSI's shelter-data maintenance web system). 14 characters: fixed 'E' + 5-digit municipality code + 5-digit facility code + major type code ('1' = designated shelter, the only value valid on this model) + minor type code ('1' = general shelter, '2' = welfare shelter) + a 1-character sequence starting at 1 (never 0). Also published as the '共通ID' column of GSI's designated-shelter CSV data. Optional: omit the property entirely, rather than send an empty string, when no ID is assigned yet"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/disaster/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/disaster/EvacuationShelter/#nationalShelterId"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/disaster/openedAt",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "openedAt"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "開設日時",
        "en": "Time the shelter opened"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/disaster/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/disaster/EvacuationShelter/#openedAt"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/disaster/openingStatus",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "openingStatus"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "正規化した開設状況: open（開設中）、closed（未開設・閉鎖）、full（満員）、requested（開設を依頼・指示されたが開設未確認。公的な統制語彙は見つからなかった区分）。現場の呼び方は必ず statusLabel にも記載する",
        "en": "Normalised opening state: open, closed, full (open but at capacity), requested (opening has been requested/instructed but not yet confirmed open; no public controlled vocabulary defines this state). The local wording always also goes in statusLabel"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/disaster/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/disaster/EvacuationShelter/#openingStatus"
    }
  ]
}
